M1002 judge_flag timelapse_record_flag
M622 J1
G92 E0
G1 Z0.96
G1 X0 Y90 ; move to safe pos
G1 X-13.0 F3000 ; move to safe pos
M400
M1004 S5 P1  ; external shutter
M400 P300
M971 S11 C11 O0
G92 E0
G1 X0 F18000
M623

